From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 17:11:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] propagate damage through shadow roots

propagate_damage_flags bailed on any node without stylo_element_data. A
shadow root has none, so the walk returned before traversing the shadow
subtree: box-construction damage and layout-cache clears for content
inside a shadow tree never ran, and the nodes could not get boxes no
matter what damage they carried. caniuse renders every feature card into
ciu-feature-list's shadow tree, so search results stopped painting once
incremental layout landed.

Pass through a shadow root to its children instead of returning empty,
and hoist the attached-shadow-root hop out of the else branch so a host
traversing its cached layout_children still visits its shadow subtree.

Against blitz-dom 0.3.0-beta.3: upstream's propagate walk always visits
DOM children plus the shadow-root hop (no cached layout_children
branch), so only the shadow-root pass-through remains; shadow roots are
also exempt from the damaged-descendants skip since they carry no flag.
---
 src/layout/damage.rs | 11 ++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/layout/damage.rs b/src/layout/damage.rs
index c91fb76..a34f0a2 100644
--- a/src/layout/damage.rs
+++ b/src/layout/damage.rs
@@ -59,6 +59,11 @@ impl BaseDocument {
             .and_then(|s| s.get_mut())
         {
             data.damage
+        } else if self.nodes[node_id].is_shadow_root() {
+            // A shadow root has no stylo data, but bailing here strands damage
+            // inside the shadow subtree. Pass through shadow roots (they carry
+            // no damaged-descendants flag either, so never skip them below).
+            RestyleDamage::empty()
         } else {
             return RestyleDamage::empty();
         };
@@ -70,7 +75,11 @@ impl BaseDocument {
         // ancestors may reach it only through an unflagged anonymous wrapper.
         {
             let node = &self.nodes[node_id];
-            if damage.is_empty() && !node.has_damaged_descendants() && !node.is_anonymous() {
+            if damage.is_empty()
+                && !node.has_damaged_descendants()
+                && !node.is_anonymous()
+                && !node.is_shadow_root()
+            {
                 return RestyleDamage::empty();
             }
         }
